- The criterion applies globally to all pores in `part["pores"]` without zone filtering, and a part with no considered pores is accepted.
- Exact IEEE 754 floating-point comparisons are used without an extra tolerance margin, with `math.fsum` used so cluster diameter summation does not depend on pore ordering.

