- Only pores with `d_eq_mm >= 0.15` are counted.
- A pore is located by its `centroid`, and the check tests all possible placements of an axis-aligned 5 mm × 5 mm × 5 mm reference cube (not a fixed grid) so clusters straddling grid boundaries are still caught.
